# Build output. No .gitkeep placeholder: `vite build` empties the directory, which
# deleted the tracked file and made it flip-flop in and out of six commits. rust_embed
# 8.x tolerates the folder being absent (verified on a fresh clone), so nothing needs it
# to exist at checkout time — real builds go through Dockerfile.hub, which builds the
# frontend and copies dist in.
/frontend/dist/
